2. Manufacturer label excerpts (content/labels/)
=======================================================================

US drug label excerpts come from openFDA / DailyMed (U.S. Food and Drug
Administration, U.S. National Library of Medicine). The label text is
written by manufacturers. It is a draft lane and is not part of any
signed bundle until legal review is complete
(docs/manufacturer-label-licensing.md). Kenya PPB and SAHPRA documents are
linked only; no text is stored.

